@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & LOGIN FOR DIFFERENT USERS
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 1a. Login as Super Admin (Has all roles & full permissions)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### 1b. Login as Operations Manager (Has Users.View, Reports.View, Reports.Export)
# @name managerLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manager@example.com",
  "password": "Manager@123456"
}

### 1c. Login as Standard Employee (Has Users.View only)
# @name userLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@123456"
}

### Active tokens for requests below
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.accessToken}}
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.accessToken}}


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. TESTING DYNAMIC POLICIES (IAuthorizationPolicyProvider)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 2a. Dynamic Permission: 'Users.View'
### SUCCESS for Admin, Manager, and Standard User
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/resources/users-list
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2b. Dynamic Permission: 'Reports.Export'
### SUCCESS for Admin and Manager, 403 FORBIDDEN for Standard User
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/resources/export-financial-report
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2c. Dynamic Permission: 'Users.Create'
### SUCCESS for Admin, 403 FORBIDDEN for Standard User
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/resources/create-user-record
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2d. Dynamic Permission: 'Users.Delete'
### SUCCESS for Admin, 403 FORBIDDEN for Standard User
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/resources/delete-user-record/123
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2e. Unauthenticated Access Test (No Bearer Token)
### Expect: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/resources/users-list
Accept: application/json

### 2f. Forbidden Access Test (Insufficient Permission)
### Expect: 403 Forbidden (Standard user trying to access admin create-user endpoint)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/resources/create-user-record
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. DYNAMICALLY GRANTING PERMISSIONS AT RUNTIME
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 3a. Admin grants 'Users.Create' permission to user@example.com
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/grant-permission
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "permission": "Users.Create"
}

### 3b. After user logs in again, they can now call 'create-user-record'!
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@123456"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. IDEMPOTENCY TESTING (Double-Charge & Network Retry Protection)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 4a. Initial Payment Charge (First Request -> Processed Normally)
### Expect: 200 OK with X-Cache: IDEMPOTENT-MISS and a new transactionId
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/payments/charge
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pay-key-unique-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 99.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "orderReference": "ORD-2026-9876",
  "description": "Premium Subscription"
}

### 4b. Immediate Retry of Payment Charge (Exact Same Idempotency-Key & Payload)
### Expect: 200 OK with X-Cache: IDEMPOTENT-HIT and the EXACT SAME transactionId (No double-charge!)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/payments/charge
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pay-key-unique-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 99.99,
  "currency": "USD",
  "orderReference": "ORD-2026-9876",
  "description": "Premium Subscription"
}

### 4c. Conflict Test: Same Idempotency-Key with MODIFIED Payload ($150 instead of $99.99)
### Expect: 422 Unprocessable Entity (Key reuse detected with altered parameters)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/payments/charge
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pay-key-unique-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "orderReference": "ORD-2026-9876",
  "description": "Premium Subscription"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. GLOBAL EXCEPTION HANDLING & RFC 7807/9457 PROBLEM DETAILS
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 5a. Test 404 Not Found Exception
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/errors/not-found
Accept: application/json

### 5b. Test 409 Conflict Exception
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/errors/conflict
Accept: application/json

### 5c. Test 400 Domain Rule Violation Exception
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/errors/domain-error
Accept: application/json

### 5d. Test 403 Forbidden Exception
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/errors/forbidden
Accept: application/json

### 5e. Test 500 Server Error (Unhandled Exception masked for security)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/errors/server-error
Accept: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. PRODUCT MANAGEMENT & CACHING (In-Memory & Output Cache)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 6a. Get In-Memory Cached Products (IMemoryCache in Application Layer)
### Fetches all products or specific category from memory cache
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/in-memory-cached
Accept: application/json

### 6b. Get In-Memory Cached Products by Category
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/in-memory-cached?category=Laptops
Accept: application/json

### 6c. Get Output Cached Products ([OutputCache] Middleware Layer)
### Notice 'generatedAtUtc' timestamp remains identical for 60 seconds (Controller skipped!)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/output-cached
Accept: application/json

### 6d. Get Output Cached Products by Route Value (VaryByRoute: Laptops)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/category/Laptops
Accept: application/json

### 6e. Get Output Cached Products by Route Value (VaryByRoute: Audio)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/category/Audio
Accept: application/json

### 6f. Create Product (Authenticated as Admin / Product Creator)
### Creates product and INVALIDATES both In-Memory Cache and OutputCache ('products-tag')
# @name createProduct
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "iPad Pro M4 13-inch",
  "category": "Tablets",
  "price": 1299.00,
  "stockQuantity": 30
}

### 6g. Create Product Validation Error (Negative / Zero Price)
### Expect: 400 Bad Request with FluentValidation error message for 'Price'
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid Price Item",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": -19.99,
  "stockQuantity": 10
}

### 6h. Create Product Validation Error (Empty Name & Negative Stock Quantity)
### Expect: 400 Bad Request with validation errors for 'Name' and 'StockQuantity'
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": 49.99,
  "stockQuantity": -5
}

### 6i. Create Product Validation Error (Missing Category)
### Expect: 400 Bad Request with validation error for 'Category'
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Category Missing Gadget",
  "category": "",
  "price": 99.00,
  "stockQuantity": 15
}

### 6j. Verification of Output Cache Invalidation
### Notice 'generatedAtUtc' timestamp has updated immediately after Create Product evicted 'products-tag'
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/output-cached
Accept: application/json

### 6k. Verification of In-Memory Cache Invalidation
### Verify newly created product appears immediately in fresh query results
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/in-memory-cached?category=Tablets
Accept: application/json


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. STRUCTURED LOGGING & CORRELATION ID TRACING
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 7a. Request with Custom Correlation ID
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/payments/charge
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: pay-key-log-test-001
X-Correlation-ID: CORR-TRACE-12345
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "orderReference": "ORD-LOG-999",
  "description": "Enterprise Plan"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. EXCEL IMPORT & EXPORT WORKFLOWS (EPPlus Level: Expert)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 8a. Expert Template: Download Pre-Formatted Import Template (.xlsx)
### Contains instructions and Data Validation Category Dropdown list (Rows 2 to 1000)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/excel/template

### 8b. Expert Export: Download Complete Styled Product Catalog (.xlsx)
### Downloads .xlsx with Table Styles, Freeze Panes, Currency formatting, Formulas, and Conditional Formatting
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/excel/export-products

### 8c. Expert Export: Download Filtered Product Catalog (.xlsx by Category)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/excel/export-products?category=Laptops

### 8d. Expert Import: Upload Excel File (.xlsx)
### Parses rows, validates fields, batch inserts valid entities, and purges Output Cache tags
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/excel/import-products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Product_Import_Template.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./Product_Import_Template.xlsx
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 8e. Expert Import Validation Error: Unsupported File Extension
### Expect: 400 Bad Request ("Only .xlsx Excel files are supported.")
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/excel/import-products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invalid_data.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

Product Name,Category,Price,Stock Quantity
Test,Laptops,100,5
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 8f. Verification After Excel Import
### Query in-memory cache to verify newly imported items are immediately available
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/in-memory-cached
Accept: application/json
